          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features03\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n    <header>Cards</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\"><input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n          <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n            <b>Grandora</b></h4>\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n            To add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n          </h5>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/creativespace1.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">CreativeSpace</h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Players can create their own levels or mini-games through the 'CreativeSpace' system. They can choose the environment and theme based on the assets provided</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/creativespace2.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>Monster Setting</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Players can spawn enemies and set their attributes and behaviors as they wish</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/creativespace3.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>VR Experience Demo</b>\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">You can use a transform tools&nbsp; just like the Unity engine.</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/creativespace4.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Auto Generate Level</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">The system can also auto-generate levels</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/grandora-central-hub.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"4\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>Cmmunity Hub</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">There is a central map where players can meet and talk with each other.</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/grandora-minigame-1.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"5\" data-bs-slide-to=\"5\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>Platform Minigame</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">You can create mini-games using the Creative Space system</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/grandora-dungeon-hub.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"6\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>Dungeon Minigame</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">You can create mini-dungeons and monsters as desired.</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/grandora-minigame-splash-festival.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"7\" data-bs-slide-to=\"7\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>Mini Event Songkarn</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">An online shooting mini-game for the Songkran Day event</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gatherccg.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"8\" data-bs-slide-to=\"8\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>Gather CCG</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">https://store.steampowered.com/app/3861520/Gather_CCG/</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">An online turn-based card game where you build your own deck.</p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_name": "features03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_anchor": "features03-6",
          "_cid": "v1BRO5FkZM",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item-subtitle": {
              "line-height": "1.2",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "img, .item-img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "100%",
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showText)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showButtons)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item:focus, span:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".item": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@spacing)": {
              ".row": {
                "margin-left": "0",
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              ".item": {
                "padding": "0",
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "height": "100%",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-flow": "column nowrap"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features03\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n    <header>Cards</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\"><input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n          <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>BOBA Online</b></h4>\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n            To add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n          </h5>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/boba1.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>Moba + Bomberman&nbsp;</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">A 3vs3 MOBA + Bomberman hybrid game&nbsp;</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/boba2.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">Skill &amp; Bomb</h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Players can choose to either place bombs or use combat skills. Item acquisition is like in Bomberman, where you find items in boxes that are randomly placed around the map</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mapeditortool-999x553.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <b>Map Editor</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">It has a spawn point system and you can design levels in various formats</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_name": "features03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_anchor": "features03-0",
          "_cid": "v1BFUDE9d9",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item-subtitle": {
              "line-height": "1.2",
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "img, .item-img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "100%",
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showText)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showButtons)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item:focus, span:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".item": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@spacing)": {
              ".row": {
                "margin-left": "0",
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              ".item": {
                "padding": "0",
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "height": "100%",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-flow": "column nowrap"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features03\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n    <header>Cards</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\"><input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n          <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n            <b>Rythm Game</b></h4>\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n            To add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n          </h5>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/tapstar.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>ECS</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">A rhythm game using the Hybrid ECS system</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/sunset1-1854x650.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Rythm Editor</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">You can edit the rhythm (beat map) to the music. The system will automatically generate the grid spacing (or 'slot width') based on each song's BPM</p>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Play</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
